{"html":"\n    \n    \n\n<div id=\"lp-pom-root\"><div id=\"lp-pom-root-color-overlay\"></div><div><div id=\"lp-pom-box-16\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-16-color-overlay\"></div><div id=\"lp-pom-box-18\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-18-color-overlay\"></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-14\"><div><img src=\"media/8e17c690a3d5-77788646-aeos-logo-cmyk_10go03k000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><a id=\"lp-pom-button-15\" href=\"tel:9378004957\"><span>(937) 800-4957</span></a><div id=\"lp-pom-image-47\"><div><a href=\"tel:9378004957\" aria-label=\"Call 9378004957\"><img src=\"media/ca7144d0c857-1d3bc9c6-call-icon_101c01c000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-165\"><div><a href=\"#/oculoplastics-consultation/?section=lp-pom-box-44\" aria-label=\"View image\"><img src=\"media/e7211a07eb6e-3cef64df-schedule-icon_101e01g000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div></div></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-21\"><p><span>Consultation</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-22\"><p><span>Schedule Your</span></p></div><a id=\"lp-pom-button-23\" href=\"#/oculoplastics-consultation/?section=lp-pom-box-44\"><span>Today &gt;&gt;</span></a><div id=\"lp-code-24\"><iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/d/embed?mid=1mxM4FdOGDZRA3maYmUknctrJqcFUz8U&amp;ehbc=2E312F&amp;noprof=1\" title=\"Practice location map\" loading=\"lazy\" allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"source-embed\"></iframe></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-29\"><p><span><span>*In-office, upper bleph both eyes, must have consultation between 6/1/26-10/31/26. Exclusions may apply. †Financing OAC.&nbsp;</span>©2026, AestheticEye. All rights reserved.&nbsp;</span><a href=\"#/privacy-policy/\"><span>Privacy Policy.</span></a></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-box-36\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-36-color-overlay\"></div><a id=\"lp-pom-button-34\" href=\"#/oculoplastics-consultation/?section=lp-pom-box-44\"><span>Schedule Your Consultation</span></a></div><div id=\"lp-pom-box-40\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-40-color-overlay\"></div><div id=\"lp-pom-form-41\"><iframe src=\"https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/form/zrbsgRHnE2gIYj6TzOuF\" title=\"Contact AestheticEye to request a consultation\" id=\"inline-zrbsgRHnE2gIYj6TzOuF\" class=\"source-survey\" data-form-id=\"zrbsgRHnE2gIYj6TzOuF\" data-layout-iframe-id=\"inline-zrbsgRHnE2gIYj6TzOuF\" data-height=\"942\"></iframe></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-43\"><p><span>Request Your Consultation Now</span></p></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-box-44\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-44-color-overlay\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-50\"><div><img src=\"media/3abf347948dc-2a139a1d-abo-logo_1000000000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-51\"><div><img src=\"media/4ce2f0f5e6c1-1443477e-aao-3x_10bk03c000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-55\"><div><img src=\"media/1fde2c20e6a6-f547f38a-top-docs-logo-2026-color_107e05o07c05o000000028.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-60\"><p><span>Before &amp; Afters</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-box-61\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-61-color-overlay\"></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-226\"><div><img src=\"media/950965737551-c82c0adc-ba-upper-1_1000000000000000000028.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-227\"><div><img src=\"media/376b10eb1cbe-f6a96859-ba-upper-2_1000000000000000000028.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-228\"><div><img src=\"media/fb73e43a5829-393545e5-ba-upper-3_1000000000000000000028.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-229\"><div><img src=\"media/6c1b1f9beb49-2229a060-ba-lower-1_1000000000000000000028.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-230\"><div><img src=\"media/48b8a713a16e-56fd01bd-ba-lower-2_1000000000000000000028.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-231\"><div><img src=\"media/95464261d300-9b091613-ba-lower-3_1000000000000000000028.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-232\"><div><img src=\"media/8f0b2c783035-da3317fa-ba-brow-1_1000000000000000000028.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-233\"><div><img src=\"media/aaf72f9665ad-9fd19336-ba-brow-2_1000000000000000000028.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-234\"><div><img src=\"media/e47fbce0bdfa-111e50c5-ba-brow-3_1000000000000000000028.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-65\"><p><span>I had eyelid surgery two weeks ago and I am extremely happy with the results. Dr. Pargament explained clearly what the problems were and what the surgery would involve. He is very knowledgeable and answered all my questions patiently. Every person I spoke with throughout the process was courteous and helpful. I would highly recommend him.</span></p><p><span>Karen G.</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-67\"><p><span>Patient Review</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-69\"><div><img src=\"media/dc4ee24fc9be-0802101f-acs-logo_1000000000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-70\"><div><img src=\"media/bff4684961ea-a17fb62f-qoutes-icon_105004a000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-72\"><p><span>Cosmetic Oculoplastic Procedures</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-75\"><p><span>DROOPING UPPER EYELIDS</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-78\"><p><span>Correcting drooping upper eyelids is one of our specialties. This procedure, known as blepharoplasty, can significantly improve your field of vision and provide a more youthful and alert appearance.</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-box-79\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-79-color-overlay\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-83\"><p><span>LOWER EYELID BAGS</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-box-84\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-84-color-overlay\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-85\"><p><span>We offer advanced techniques to address lower eyelid bags and puffiness, rejuvenating your under-eye area and creating a refreshed look.</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-90\"><p><span>BROW AND FOREHEAD LIFTS</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-box-91\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-91-color-overlay\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-92\"><p><span>Our brow and forehead lift procedures elevate sagging brows and smooth out deep forehead lines, offering a rejuvenated and more youthful appearance.</span></p></div><a id=\"lp-pom-button-93\" href=\"#/oculoplastics-consultation/?section=lp-pom-box-44\"><span>Schedule Your Consultation</span></a><div id=\"lp-pom-box-96\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-96-color-overlay\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-97\"><p><span>Your Eyes Deserve Excellence</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-98\"><p><span>Jonathan Pargament, MD</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-99\"><p><span>Ginger Henson, MD</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-box-100\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-100-color-overlay\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-102\"><p><span>Board Certified Oculofacial Plastic Surgeon, Fellowship Trained in Oculofacial Plastic and Reconstructive Surgery</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-box-103\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-103-color-overlay\"></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-104\"><div><img src=\"media/c878fd911c63-76fe7cbc-play-icon_102802s000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-105\"><p><span>Watch Video</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-box-109\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-109-color-overlay\"></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-110\"><div><img src=\"media/c878fd911c63-76fe7cbc-play-icon_102802s000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-111\"><p><span>Watch Video</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-112\"><p><span>Board Certified Oculofacial Plastic Surgeon, Fellowship Trained in Ophthalmic Plastic and Reconstructive Surgery</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-114\"><p><span><em>In some cases, upper eyelid surgery may be covered by insurance if heavy upper eyelids are interfering with your vision. We will do testing to determine if there will be insurance coverage.</em></span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-116\"><p><span>\"Dr. Ginger Henson was a perfect choice for me! She did an excellent job. I had no pain and healed up better than ever! I'm so happy with the job she did for me!\"</span></p><p><span>Lynne S.</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-117\"><div><img src=\"media/f6bfd8f44c88-a17fb62f-qoutes-icon_105004c05004a000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-120\"><p><span>Non-Surgical Treatments and Professional Skin Care</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-121\"><p><span>Our highly trained medical aesthetician, led by board certified oculofacial plastic surgeons, offers a variety of non-surgical treatments to deliver exceptional, natural-looking results.</span></p></div><a id=\"lp-pom-button-122\" href=\"#/oculoplastics-consultation/?section=lp-pom-box-44\"><span>Schedule Your Consultation</span></a><a id=\"lp-pom-button-123\" href=\"#/oculoplastics-consultation/?section=lp-pom-box-44\"><span>Schedule Your Consultation</span></a><div id=\"lp-pom-box-125\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-125-color-overlay\"></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-126\"><p><span>Sofwave Skin Tightening Treatments</span></p><p><span>Laser Treatments</span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>Dark Circle Treatments</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>Non-Surgical Eyelid Lift</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>Fillers &amp; Injectables</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>Microneedling</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>Chemical Peels</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>Dermaplane</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>HydraFacial</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>Brow &amp; Lash Enhancements</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span>Professional Skin Care Products</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-213\"><div><img src=\"media/bff9892aa9e7-87951ba6-bullet-point_101e01e000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-214\"><div><img src=\"media/bff9892aa9e7-87951ba6-bullet-point_101e01e000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-215\"><div><img src=\"media/bff9892aa9e7-87951ba6-bullet-point_101e01e000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-218\"><div><img src=\"media/bff9892aa9e7-87951ba6-bullet-point_101e01e000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-219\"><div><img src=\"media/bff9892aa9e7-87951ba6-bullet-point_101e01e000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-220\"><div><img src=\"media/bff9892aa9e7-87951ba6-bullet-point_101e01e000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-221\"><div><img src=\"media/bff9892aa9e7-87951ba6-bullet-point_101e01e000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-222\"><div><img src=\"media/bff9892aa9e7-87951ba6-bullet-point_101e01e000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-223\"><div><img src=\"media/bff9892aa9e7-87951ba6-bullet-point_101e01e000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-224\"><div><img src=\"media/bff9892aa9e7-87951ba6-bullet-point_101e01e000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-254\"><div><img src=\"media/bff9892aa9e7-87951ba6-bullet-point_101e01e000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-box-145\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-145-color-overlay\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-147\"><div><img src=\"media/11119cf82741-a0947a34-aeos-logo-1c-wht_10hy03u03o03u000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-166\"><p><span>You Deserve to Feel Confident</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-167\"><p><span>RESTORE YOUTHFUL LOOKING EYES</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-168\"><p><span>Take the first step towards rejuvenating your eyes and enhancing your natural beauty. Request your consultation today!</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-171\"><p><span>Dr. Ginger Henson and Dr. Jonathan Pargament have distinguished backgrounds, with extensive training and experience in oculoplastic surgery. Their commitment to patient-centered care and use of the latest surgical techniques ensure that you receive the highest standard of care at AestheticEye.</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-173\"><div><img src=\"media/5f50ea75ce85-2e2406eb-visioninsurance-icon_103g03c000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-box-178\"><div id=\"lp-pom-box-178-color-overlay\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-text-180\"><p><span>ENHANCE YOUR APPEARANCE WITH MINIMAL DOWNTIME</span></p></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-196\"><div><img src=\"media/0c1942d3752c-68efb252-dr-pargament-2x_10b40b4000000000000028.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div id=\"lp-pom-image-201\"><div><img src=\"media/8e2dc9e8e8a9-d73f5f2f-dr-henson-2x_10b40b4000000